    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="16">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 16</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif mon cu oððe stodmyran forstele ⁊ folan oððe cealf ófadrife, forgelde mid scill ⁊ þa moder be hiora weorðe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a person steals a cow or stud-mare and drives away a foal or calf, let him compensate with a shilling and for the mothers according to their worth.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone steals a cow or a broodmare, and drives off a foal or a calf, he shall pay for the latter a shilling, and for the mothers according to their value.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif mon cu oþþe stodmyran forstele ⁊ folan oððe cealf ofadrifeð, forgilde mid scyllinge ⁊ ða moder be heora weorðe.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
